WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.504
Priya: Just to recap, the next update is nine. That's local time on the incident record.
小结一下，下次更新九点，按事件记录上的本地时区。

2
00:00:06.504 --> 00:00:14.136
Lukas: I've got it from here on coordination. Two workers remain rerouted; primary diagnosis stays open.
协调从这里我接手。两个工作进程维持绕行，主线诊断尚未结束。

3
00:00:14.136 --> 00:00:22.607
Raj: Okay, the mitigation is holding for those workers. Saved configurations and evidence references are attached.
好，这些工作进程缓解仍有效。已附保存配置和证据引用。

4
00:00:22.607 --> 00:00:31.223
Hannah: I'll request the carrier's pending diagnostic update. No reply still becomes an explicit status.
我会索取运营商尚未给出的诊断更新。未回复也会明确报状态。

5
00:00:31.223 --> 00:00:38.399
Anika: I'll monitor reconciliation and both client groups. Any correctness issue gets an immediate page.
我监控核对和两类客户端。任何正确性问题立即呼叫。

6
00:00:38.399 --> 00:00:45.839
Priya: Just to confirm, threshold breaches update earlier, right? Don't wait for the scheduled nine.
我确认一下，超过门槛要提前更新，对吧？不等计划九点。

7
00:00:45.839 --> 00:00:53.543
Lukas: Correct, and routing changes need capacity assessment. We won't automatically restore the primary path.
对，路由变化需评估容量，不自动恢复主路径。

8
00:00:53.543 --> 00:01:00.694
Raj: If asked what's the ETA, distinguish diagnosis. We still have no repair estimate.
被问预计多久时要区分诊断，目前仍没有修复时间估计。

9
00:01:00.694 --> 00:01:09.454
Hannah: Understood, ticket evidence before any recovery claim. Quiet probes alone won't close this incident.
明白，宣称恢复前需要工单证据。探测平静不能单独关闭事件。

10
00:01:09.454 --> 00:01:16.750
Priya: So, handoff accepted at roughly eight forty-five. Update at nine even without new findings.
因此大约八点四十五接受交接。即使没有新发现，九点也更新。

